1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,875
[CAM Wide]
CUBY: Hey! I'm Cuby.
I'm a cube, obviously.

2
00:00:01,875 --> 00:00:03,750
SPHERO: I'm Sphero!
Round, zero corners!

3
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:05,625
[CAM Cuby]
CUBY: We're super
low-effort models.

4
00:00:05,625 --> 00:00:07,500
[CAM Sphero]
SPHERO: Just primitives
and a dream!

5
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,375
[CAM Cuby]
CUBY: But subtitles?
Real 3D geometry!

6
00:00:09,375 --> 00:00:11,250
[CAM Sphero]
SPHERO: They type live,
letter by letter!

7
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:13,125
[CAM Cuby]
CUBY: Drag my keyframes
in the Timeline!

8
00:00:13,125 --> 00:00:15,000
[CAM Wide]
BOTH: One more thing -
pick a robot!

9
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
[CAM Wide]
Who gets the last word?
